1	//! Ops credentials page — contract/credential document management and e-signing.
2	//!
3	//! Layout:
4	//!   • Header  — title, "Upload Document" button, "Run Expiry Sweep" (Admin|Dispatcher)
5	//!   • Filters — status select
6	//!   • Split view: credential list  ←→  detail panel
7	//!     - Detail: info card + Review form (pending + can_approve) + E-sign form + Audit log
8	//!   • Upload form (shown inline at top when active)
9	//!
10	//! RBAC (enforced by backend; mirrored here for UX):
11	//!   ViewCredentials:   Admin, OpsAgent, Dispatcher
12	//!   ApproveCredentials: Admin, Dispatcher
